==Trivia==
===Origin===
*'''Crystal Body''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} that first appeared as a {{TCG|Pokémon Power}} on {{TCG ID|Neo Revelation|Suicune|14}} from the {{TCG|Neo Revelation}} expansion.
